{"content":[{"c":["SALCAH*, SALCHAH*, SALECAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["City or district that formed the northeastern extremity of the Amorite kingdom of Og in Bashan, east of the Jordan River. Salecah (variously spelled Salcah and Salchah in the ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},") was located near the city of Edrei (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.12.5","r":"Josh.12.5","rawR":"Josh.12.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.12.5","value":"Josh.12.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 12:5"},"). The Israelites gained possession of this city when they defeated Og (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.3.10","r":"Deut.3.10","rawR":"Deut.3.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.3.10","value":"Deut.3.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 3:10"},"). Later, Salecah was included in the land received by Gad’s tribe for an inheritance (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.13.11","r":"Josh.13.11","rawR":"Josh.13.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.13.11","value":"Josh.13.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 13:11"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.5.11","r":"1Chr.5.11","rawR":"1Chr.5.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.5.11","value":"1Chr.5.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 5:11"},"). The city is identifiable with the modern town of Salkhad."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"SalcahSalchahSalecah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 12:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.12.5","rawQueryValue":"Josh.12.5","sourceRefExact":"Josh.12.5"},{"anchorText":"Dt 3:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.3.10","rawQueryValue":"Deut.3.10","sourceRefExact":"Deut.3.10"},{"anchorText":"Jos 13:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.13.11","rawQueryValue":"Josh.13.11","sourceRefExact":"Josh.13.11"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 5:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.5.11","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.5.11","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.5.11"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"ac82ab2b672074dbe2308b9f53f3453e95b5f6b5ed94d3ae17770968b1a11944","sourceItemName":"SalcahSalchahSalecah","sourceItemOrder":27,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"SalcahSalchahSalecah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Salcah*, Salchah*, Salecah","title":"Salcah*, Salchah*, Salecah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}